{"stem": "granulator2", "name": "granulator2", "description": "Granulator 2\n\nA modern, N-grain granular synthesizer (N = 8) written against the\nmature Crag IR.  Every grain draws an *individual* value from a\nuser-controlled [min, max] range for its playback speed, grain size\n(envelope period) and envelope skew, so the grain cloud is genuinely\nheterogeneous rather than copies of one voice.\n\nThe grains share one crag.parallel body parameterised by a line index;\neach grain's distinct values arrive as capture tensors (u_win, u_spd, ...).\ncrag-unroll-parallel expands the constant line count into 8 independent\ninlined grains at compile time.\n\nControls\n--------\n  grains        [1, 8]      number of grains audible at once (runtime int)\n  window_pos    [0, 1]      scrub position of the source window (left edge)\n  window_size   [0.01, 1]   width of the source window as a fraction of the file\n  speed_min/max [-2, 2]     playback-speed range; grain i advances the read\n                            head at speed_i samples / output sample\n  grain_ms_min/max [20,500] grain duration range in ms (sets the envelope rate)\n  skew_min/max  [0.05,0.95] envelope skew range; 0.5 = symmetric, < 0.5 = fast\n                            attack / slow decay, > 0.5 = slow attack / fast decay\n  output_gain   [0, 2]      overall output level\n\nEach grain i derives value_i = min + u_i * (max - min) from its per-grain\nspread factor u_i; a runtime `grains` count gates which grains are audible\n(grain i is silent when i >= grains).\n\nSampler:  \"audio\" - bind a WAV via crag_bind_audio_by_index(0, ptr, len).\nOutput:   !crag.audio<f32, 48000, 2> - stereo.\n\nVisualizer: \"granulator2_viz\" - source waveform + scrub window + live grains.", "sr": 48000, "ch": 1, "build_meta": {"gen_datetime": "2026-06-30 03:30 UTC", "git_commit": "3343af5", "compiled_with": "3343af5"}, "wasm": "granulator2.wasm", "meta_file": "granulator2.wasm.cragmeta", "meta": {"schema_version": 1, "sample_rate": 48000, "channels": 1, "parameters": [{"name": "grains", "type": "int", "min": 1, "max": 8, "default": 6, "int_index": 0}, {"name": "window_pos", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "default": 0.1, "float_index": 0}, {"name": "window_size", "type": "float", "min": 0.01, "max": 1.0, "default": 0.25, "float_index": 1}, {"name": "speed_min", "type": "float", "min": -2.0, "max": 2.0, "default": 1.0, "float_index": 2}, {"name": "speed_max", "type": "float", "min": -2.0, "max": 2.0, "default": 1.0, "float_index": 3}, {"name": "grain_ms_min", "type": "float", "min": 20.0, "max": 500.0, "default": 80.0, "unit": "ms", "float_index": 4}, {"name": "grain_ms_max", "type": "float", "min": 20.0, "max": 500.0, "default": 140.0, "unit": "ms", "float_index": 5}, {"name": "skew_min", "type": "float", "min": 0.05, "max": 0.95, "default": 0.5, "float_index": 6}, {"name": "skew_max", "type": "float", "min": 0.05, "max": 0.95, "default": 0.5, "float_index": 7}, {"name": "output_gain", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 2.0, "default": 0.7, "float_index": 8}], "samplers": ["audio"], "texture_samplers": [], "events": [], "meters": [{"name": "Output", "type": "float", "min": 0.0, "max": 1.0, "float_index": 0}], "visualizers": [{"name": "granulator2_viz", "width": 512, "height": 256, "audio_capture": "pcm", "audio_buf_elems": 512}], "has_visualizer": true, "has_audio_output": true, "viz_width": 512, "viz_height": 256, "compiled_with": "3343af5"}, "mca": {"graph": "granulator2", "block_size": 512, "results": [{"label": "Intel Haswell (x86-64-v3)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "haswell", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 0.9827, "block_rthroughput": 735.5, "cycles_per_sample": 1.4365, "insns_per_block": 1611, "uops_per_block": 2942}, {"label": "Intel Skylake-AVX512 (x86-64-v4)", "triple": "x86_64-linux-gnu", "march": "x86-64", "mcpu": "skylake-avx512", "arch": "x86-64", "ipc": 1.1421, "block_rthroughput": 486.5, "cycles_per_sample": 0.9502, "insns_per_block": 1611, "u